    "semanticRules": [
      "preview proof固定`helix://contracts/application-types/ArcaJavCorrectionPreviewProof/v1`、JCS≤2 MiB",
      "完整Arca Basis/新Proposal/精确旧新路径/target reality不可更新，受理不发布新Canonical Fact、不产生文件副作用。`UNIQUE(shelf_entry_id,actor_id,idempotency_key)`",
