      "`INDEX(shelf_entry_id,state)`。仅state/state_revision/terminal evidence/timestamps可expected-state/revision CAS",
      "admitted→active/cancelled，active→attention_required/committed，attention_required→active/cancelled",
      "已开始正式文件Effect时不得cancelled，须恢复同一scope。terminal时Evidence/timestamp整体write-once",
      "成功事实必须由独立Correction Inventory Commit提交，禁止以状态变化冒充成功"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`correction_id PK, shelf_entry_id FK, preview_id, preview_proof_schema_ref, preview_proof_json, basis_digest, proposal_digest, placement_preview_digest, actor_id, idempotency_key, admission_digest, state(admitted|active|attention_required|committed|cancelled), state_revision, terminal_evidence_digest NULL, committed_context_schema_ref NULL, committed_context_json NULL, committed_context_digest NULL, cleanup_state(pending|active|attention_required|completed) NULL, cleanup_receipt_schema_ref NULL, cleanup_receipt_json NULL, cleanup_receipt_digest NULL, recovery_intent_schema_ref NULL, recovery_intent_json NULL, recovery_intent_digest NULL, created_at_ms, updated_at_ms, terminal_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "preview proof固定`helix://contracts/application-types/ArcaJavCorrectionPreviewProof/v1`、JCS≤2 MiB；完整Arca Basis/新Proposal/精确旧新路径/target reality不可更新，受理不发布新Canonical Fact、不产生文件副作用。`UNIQUE(shelf_entry_id,actor_id,idempotency_key)`；`UNIQUE(shelf_entry_id) WHERE terminal_at_ms IS NULL OR cleanup_state IN (pending,active,attention_required)`；`INDEX(shelf_entry_id,state)`。仅state/state_revision/terminal evidence/timestamps可expected-state/revision CAS；admitted→active/cancelled，active→attention_required/committed，attention_required→active/cancelled；已开始正式文件Effect时不得cancelled，须恢复同一scope。terminal时Evidence/timestamp整体write-once；成功事实必须由独立Correction Inventory Commit提交，禁止以状态变化冒充成功"
    },
